BTgKL6Z73lis\u002Frs:fit:2560:0:0:0\u002Fq:95\u002FaHR0cHM6Ly9zdG9yYWdlLmdvb2dsZWFwaXMuY29tL3N0YW5mb3JkLXByb2QvMjAyNi8wNS8xOS9ndGkwUlJXZEZDeWVQank0WHA0ZHVOSEd6QXlBdG02WkhYemtSaGs4LmpwZw.jpg 2560w, https:\u002F\u002Fgostanford.com\u002Fimgproxy\u002FccUcM1EUPLJHOI7eYuGthZ3ZStY-w4o6Bsdp2bBKqaA\u002Frs:fit:3840:0:0:0\u002Fq:95\u002FaHR0cHM6Ly9zdG9yYWdlLmdvb2dsZWFwaXMuY29tL3N0YW5mb3JkLXByb2QvMjAyNi8wNS8xOS9ndGkwUlJXZEZDeWVQank0WHA0ZHVOSEd6QXlBdG02WkhYemtSaGs4LmpwZw.jpg 3840w","MOBILELahrkamp.jpg","center","public","Stanford, Notre Dame announce games in 2027 and 2028",true,"Announced on Wednesday morning, Stanford football and Notre Dame officially agreed to a two-year extension of their annual rivalry game, with dates set for 2027 and 2028.","2026-05-20T16:00:00.000000Z",45,{"name":50},"Brian Brownfield",[52,56],{"id":53,"name":54,"slug":55},1,"Headlines","headlines",{"id":57,"name":58,"slug":59},35,"Featured","featured",[61],{"id":62,"name":63,"uuid":64,"settings":65,"variables":69,"order":5,"shows_after":28,"shows_until":28},390270,"Paragraph","f4965b39-67b8-4e49-9930-5cc0b5c7d84d",[66],{"name":67,"value":28,"type":68},"background_color","options",[70,72],{"name":71,"value":28,"type":71},"anchor",{"name":73,"value":74,"type":75},"content","\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>STANFORD, Calif. &mdash; \u003C\u002Fstrong>Announced on Wednesday morning, Stanford football and Notre Dame officially agreed to a two-year extension of their annual rivalry game, with dates set for 2027 and 2028.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003Cp>The battle for The Legends Trophy will next return to The Farm on Nov. 27, 2027, before Stanford heads out to Notre Dame on Oct. 14, 2028.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003Cp>Both historic programs have met annually since 1997, with only one interruption due to the COVID-19 pandemic in 2020. The upcoming installment of Stanford-Notre Dame in 2026 will be the 40\u003Csup>th\u003C\u002Fsup> game played between the Cardinal and Fighting Irish.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003Cp>This year&rsquo;s game at Notre Dame Stadium is set for Oct. 10 with a 12:30 p.m. PT kickoff on NBC.\u003C\u002Fp>","wysiwyg",[77],{"id":78,"name":79,"schedule_id":80,"default_roster_id":81,"abbreviation":82,"gender":28,"slug":83,"display_ats_vs_on_calendar":45,"hide_from_dropdown":7,"hide_schedule_page_image":7,"hide_roster_page_image":7,"conference_id":84,"default_home_game_location":28,"display_next_event_on_sports_schedule":45,"default_season_id":85,"meta_description":28,"meta_image_id":28,"menu_id":86,"schedule_page_image_id":87,"roster_page_image_id":87,"score_decimal_places":5,"static_page_id":88,"hero_presented_by_url":28,"hero_presented_by_logo_id":28,"team_logo_id":28,"icon_id":28,"remove_overall_score_table":7,"calendar_code":28,"presented_by_url":28,"presented_by_logo_id":28,"schedule_top_notes":28,"enable_schedules_countdown":45,"hide_from_schedule_ticker":7,"order":5},8,"Football",1588,1779,"FB","football",2,267,40,521728,39,[],[],[],[],[],{"left":5,"top":5,"width":6,"height":6,"rotate":5,"vFlip":7,"hFlip":7,"body":95},"\u003Cpath fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M1 2h2.5l15 20h-2.5ZM5.5 2h2.5l15 20h-2.5ZM3 2h5v2h-5ZM16 20h5v2h-5ZM18.5 2h3.5l-17 20h-3.5Z\">\u003Canimate fill=\"freeze\" attributeName=\"d\" dur=\"0.8s\" keyTimes=\"0;0.3;0.5;1\" values=\"M8.5 2h2.5l0 0h-2.5ZM13 2h2.5l0 0h-2.5ZM10.5 2h5v0h-5ZM8.5 2h5v0h-5ZM10 2h3.5l0 0h-3.5Z;M8.5 2h2.5l0 20h-2.5ZM13 2h2.5l0 20h-2.5ZM10.5 2h5v2h-5ZM8.5 20h5v2h-5ZM10 2h3.5l0 20h-3.5Z;M8.5 2h2.5l0 20h-2.5ZM13 2h2.5l0 20h-2.5ZM10.5 2h5v2h-5ZM8.5 20h5v2h-5ZM10 2h3.5l0 20h-3.5Z;M1 2h2.5l15 20h-2.5ZM5.5 2h2.5l15 20h-2.5ZM3 2h5v2h-5ZM16 20h5v2h-5ZM18.5 2h3.5l-17 20h-3.5Z\"\u002F>\u003C\u002Fpath>",{"left":5,"top":5,"width":6,"height":6,"rotate":5,"vFlip":7,"hFlip":7,"body":97},"\u003Cpath fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M9.198 21.5h4v-8.01h3.604l.396-3.98h-4V7.5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3v-4h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v2.01h-2l-.396 3.98h2.396z\"\u002F>",{"left":5,"top":5,"width":6,"height":6,"rotate":5,"vFlip":7,"hFlip":7,"body":99},"\u003Cpath fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M22